OL,3,AFive teenagers stabbed at Halloween
OL,4,Aparty
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive teenagers have been seriously
OL,7,Finjured after being stabbed at a
OL,8,FHalloween party, police have said.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to Park Road in
OL,11,FChandler's Ford, near Eastleigh,
OL,12,Fshortly after 22:30 GMT on Saturday.
OL,14,FThe injured teens - three boys aged 16
OL,15,Fand two aged 17 - were taken to
OL,16,Fhospital.
OL,18,FHampshire Police said it believes an
OL,19,Funknown group gained entry to a party
OL,20,Fat an address on Park Road before the
OL,21,Fstabbings.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/38
