OL,3,ACambridge scientist dies in Spanish
OL,4,Atrain crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of two was an affiliate
OL,7,Fassociate professor leading a group of
OL,8,Fresearchers at MRC Laboratory of
OL,9,FMolecular Biology (LMB) in Cambridge
OL,10,Fand had earned several awards for work
OL,11,Fon human embryos and cell biology.
OL,13,FIn a statement, the LMB paid tribute to
OL,14,Fthe "inspiring, talented and passionate
OL,15,Fscientist" and described her death as a
OL,16,F"profound shock and a huge loss".
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/38
