OL,3,ADemocrat endorses Republican candidate
OL,4,Ain key Michigan Senate race as party
OL,5,Aspat escalates
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Democrat in Michigan has endorsed the
OL,8,FRepublican candidate in the state's
OL,9,Fcrucial US Senate contest, as a spat
OL,10,Fwith her own party's candidate Abdul
OL,11,FEl-Sayed escalated just days before the
OL,12,Fvote.
OL,14,FHaley Stevens, a sitting congresswoman
OL,15,Fwho lost out on the Democratic Senate
OL,16,Fnomination to El-Sayed, made a surprise
OL,17,Fappearance alongside the Republican
OL,18,Fcandidate Mike Rogers at a church on
OL,19,FSunday.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/38
