OL,3,ADemocrat endorses Republican candidate
OL,4,Ain key Michigan Senate race as party
OL,5,Aspat escalates
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I don't belong in Abdul's campaign,"
OL,8,Fshe said in a video posted to X shortly
OL,9,Fafter that appearance. "Who we are as
OL,10,FMichiganders is not hate and is not
OL,11,Fwhat we are getting out from our
OL,12,FDemocratic nominee right now."
OL,14,F"That's why I am endorsing Mike
OL,15,FRogers," Stevens said.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/38
